This license covers the code in this repository (scripts/, notebooks/). It
does NOT cover the redistributed data in data/:

- Census/INEC-sourced files (`datos22.xlsx` base tables, `data/model/census_indicator_*`,
  `data/model/parroquia_features*`) are derived from INEC (Instituto Nacional de
  Estadística y Censos) data, published by INEC under **Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** — confirmed at
  https://www.ecuadorencifras.gob.ec/base-de-datos-censo-de-poblacion-y-vivienda/.
  Attribute INEC when reusing.
- Electoral files (`Primera-Vuelta.sav`, `Segunda-Vuelta.sav`,
  `Organizaciones-Politicas.sav`, `parroquias.sav`, `1era.csv`/`2da.csv`/etc.)
  originate from CNE (Consejo Nacional Electoral) official public results. CNE
  does not publish an explicit open-data reuse license for these files as of
  this writing; they are public information under Ecuador's LOTAIP (Ley
  Orgánica de Transparencia y Acceso a la Información Pública). Attribute CNE
  when reusing.

See data/README.md for full provenance per file.
